摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Browser desktop notifications for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — get notified when a turn completes or an approval is needed","id":"gh:1338516687","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-notify","slug":"pedesdestiny/dsh-notify","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","notify"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Browser desktop notifications for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — get notified when a turn completes or an "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"tifications for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — get notified when a turn completes or an approval is needed"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-notify"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness (dsh) Web GUI plugin that sends browser desktop notifications when a **conversati"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"on completes** or the agent is **waiting for your confirmation**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Stop checking back on long-running tasks — work in another window and let the system tray tell you w"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"hen the agent finished or needs an approval."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Trigger | Notification |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Turn complete (`running → idle`) | \"对话完成\" + session title |\n| Tool permission approval | \"等待批准\" + "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"session title |\n| Plan review | \"等待计划审批\" + session title |\n| Agent question (`ask_user_question`) | "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"\"等待回答\" + session title |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Noise gate** — notifies only when the page is hidden or the affected session is not the selected"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" one\n- **Click to focus** — clicking a notification focuses the window; auto-closes after 10 s\n- **A"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ll sessions covered** — watches the full session list, not just the open one\n- **Silent degradation*"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"* — denied permission or missing Notification API never errors\n- **Zero host cost** — host half is a"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"n empty placeholder; pure JavaScript, no build step"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Open http://127.0.0.1:3080 and **allow** the notification permission prompt. If you previously denie"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"d it, re-enable via the browser's site settings (lock icon → Notifications)."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **`client.js`** — browser half: an invisible React component mounted in the always-rendered `shell"},{"id":"p15s2","text":".overlay` slot. It watches session-list snapshots through the standard `useSessions` hook, detects `"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"running` / `pendingInteraction` edges, and fires the `Notification` API\n- **`index.js`** — empty hos"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"t placeholder for the Loader row\n- **`cordis.patch.yml`** — bundle layer inserting the plugin row\n- "},{"id":"p15s5","text":"**`package.json`** — declares `dsh.bundle` and `dsh.client` (depends on `dsh-client-runtime` / `dsh-"},{"id":"p15s6","text":" — declares `dsh.bundle` and `dsh.client` (depends on `dsh-client-runtime` / `dsh-client-ui-layout`)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- Requires the GUI tab to remain open (background tab is fine); no notifications when the browser is"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" fully closed\n- Permission is granted per site origin (`127.0.0.1:3080`)\n- The first snapshot is a b"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"aseline: sessions that finished before page load do not notify"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"# dsh-notify（中文）"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness (dsh) Web GUI 插件：在**对话完成**或**等待用户确认**时，向你的操作系统发送浏览器桌面通知。"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"挂后台跑长任务、切去别的窗口工作时，不必再频繁回头检查对话状态——任务跑完或 Agent 需要你批准操作时，系统右下角会弹出通知。"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 功能"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| 触发时机 | 通知内容 |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| 对话完成（会话 `running → idle`） | 「对话完成」+ 会话标题 |\n| 工具权限批准（approval） | 「等待批准」+ 会话标题 |\n| 计划审批（plan review）"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" | 「等待计划审批」+ 会话标题 |\n| Agent 提问（ask_user_question） | 「等待回答」+ 会话标题 |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"特性："},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- **免打扰门槛** — 仅当页面处于后台，或受影响的会话不是当前选中的会话时才通知；你正盯着看的对话不会打扰你\n- **点击聚焦** — 点击通知回到浏览器窗口\n- **自动关闭** — 通知 1"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"0 秒后自动消失\n- **多会话覆盖** — 监听全部会话（含后台会话），不只当前打开的\n- **静默降级** — 浏览器通知权限被拒绝或 API 不可用时，插件保持沉默，绝不报错\n- **零宿主开销"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"** — 宿主端为空实现，全部逻辑在浏览器端；纯 JavaScript，无构建步骤"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## 安装"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### 方式一：git 安装（推荐）"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"本插件无构建步骤，git 安装开箱即用，无需 `allowBuilds` 授权。"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### 方式二：本地目录"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### 生效"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"打开 http://127.0.0.1:3080，浏览器弹出通知权限请求时点击**允许**。"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"> 提示：如果之前拒绝过权限，需要在浏览器站点设置中（地址栏锁图标 → 通知）手动改为允许。"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## 验证"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"1. 打开 Web GUI，切到别的窗口（让页面进入后台）\n2. 发送一个任务给 Agent\n3. 任务完成时，系统应弹出「对话完成」通知\n4. 触发一个需要批准的操作（如越权文件写入），系统应弹出「"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"eb GUI，切到别的窗口（让页面进入后台）\n2. 发送一个任务给 Agent\n3. 任务完成时，系统应弹出「对话完成」通知\n4. 触发一个需要批准的操作（如越权文件写入），系统应弹出「等待批准」通知"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## 工作原理"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"- **`client.js`** — 浏览器端核心：一个挂载在常驻 `shell.overlay` slot 的隐形 React 组件，通过标准 `useSessions` 钩子监听完整会话列表快照"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"，检测 `running` 与 `pendingInteraction` 的状态边沿并触发 `Notification` API\n- **`index.js`** — 宿主端空实现，仅为 Loader"},{"id":"p42s3","text":" 行提供合法模块\n- **`cordis.patch.yml`** — bundle 层，向配置树插入插件行\n- **`package.json`** — 声明 `dsh.bundle`（组合包）与 "},{"id":"p42s4","text":"`dsh.client`（浏览器面，依赖 `dsh-client-runtime` / `dsh-client-ui-layout`）"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## 已知限制"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"- 通知依赖浏览器 `Notification` API：**GUI 标签页必须处于打开状态**（后台标签可以）；浏览器完全关闭时不会通知\n- 通知权限按浏览器站点（`127.0.0.1:3080`）"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"粒度授予\n- 首次快照作为基线：页面加载时已经在运行的会话，其完成事件仍会正常通知；加载前已结束的不会"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## 许可证"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
